<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- Nevada $81.1 mln GO bonds.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- Nevada $81.1 mln GO bonds.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF NEVADA</p>
<p>RE: $81,090,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION (LIMITED TAX) BONDS</p>
<p>REFUNDING SERIES JULY 15, 1997 A1 &amp; A2</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD LATE ON FRIDAY.</p>
<p>NOTE CORRECTION:  THE ISSUE SPLIT INTO TWO SEPARATE SERIES</p>
<p>WITH TWO SEPARATE SETS OF CUSIP NUMBERS.</p>
<p>					     68,805,000</p>
<p>				    SERIES JULY 15, 1997 A-1</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		  S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 07/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 11/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 05/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>05/15/1998		  695M    5.00  %	  3.75</p>
<p>05/15/2003		1,475M    5.25  %	  4.55</p>
<p>05/15/2004		1,555M    5.25  %	  4.60</p>
<p>05/15/2006	     10,880M    6.00  %	  4.75</p>
<p>05/15/2007	     11,615M    6.00  %	  4.80</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>05/15/2009	     13,270M    6.00  %	  4.925</p>
<p>05/15/2010	     14,180M    6.00  %	  5.00</p>
<p>05/15/2011	     15,135M    6.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>		   EXTRAORDINARY OPTIONAL PRIOR REDEMPTION</p>
<p>				THE BONDS, OR PORTIONS THEREOF,</p>
<p>MATURING ON AND AFTER MAY 15, 2008 SHALL BE SUBJECT TO</p>
<p>REDEMPTION PRIOR TO THEIR RESPECTIVE MATURITIES, AT THE OPTION</p>
<p>OF THE STATE, ON AND AFTER MAY 15, 2007 BUT ONLY IN THE EVENT</p>
<p>THE BOARD DETERMINES A CHANGE OF USE HAS OCCURRED AS A RESULT</p>
<p>OF WHICH EXERCISE OF THIS REDEMPTION WILL IN PART SATISFY THE</p>
<p>STATE'S OBLIGATIONS UNDER SECTION 44 HEREOF IN WHOLE OR IN</p>
<p>PART AT ANY TIME FROM ANY MATURITIES SELECTED BY THE STATE AND</p>
<p>BY LOT WITHIN A MATURITY (GIVING PROPORTIONATE WEIGHT TO BONDS</p>
<p>IN DENOMINATIONS LARGER THAN $5000), AT A PRICE EQUAL TO THE</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE OF EACH BOND, OR PORTION THEREOF, SO REDEEMED,</p>
<p>ACCRUED INTEREST TO THE REDEMPTION DATE, AND A PREMIUM</p>
<p>COMPUTED IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE FOLLOWING SCHEDULE:</p>
<p>					    $105 CALL (WILL NOT DECLINE)</p>
<p>				IN THE CASE OF BONDS OF A DENOMINATION</p>
<p>LARGER THAN $5000, A PORTION OF SUCH BONDS ($5000 OR ANY</p>
<p>INTEGRAL MULTIPLE THEREOF) MAY BE REDEEMED, IN WHICH CASE THE</p>
<p>REGISTRAR SHALL, WITHOUT CHARGE TO THE OWNER OF SUCH BOND,</p>
<p>AUTHENTICATE AND ISSUE A REPLACEMENT BOND OR BONDS FOR THE</p>
<p>UNREDEEMED PORTION THEREOF.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
